OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FGenerally cloudy, though the
OL,6,Ffar north and northwest should see
OL,7,Fsome sunshine once any fog patches
OL,8,Fclear. A few showers across northern
OL,9,FEngland and Scotland, while showers in
OL,10,Fthe far southwest ease. Winds easing,
OL,11,Fthough staying chilly in the south.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FGenerally cloudy overnight,
OL,14,Fthough clearer skies in northwest
OL,15,FScotland and Northern Ireland bring a
OL,16,Frisk of fog and frost. Showers persist
OL,17,Fin northern areas, with rain reaching
OL,18,Fthe far southwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
