OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FVariable cloud and light
OL,6,Feasterly winds for most. A few showers
OL,7,Faffect eastern and northern coasts,
OL,8,Fwhile the far southwest risks heavier
OL,9,Fshowers. Patchy fog overnight.
OL,10,FTemperatures near average overall.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
